134
00:07:03,020 --> 00:07:05,260
And the short story is things that I predicted

135
00:07:05,260 --> 00:07:08,460
to be right around two weeks, from 12 to 16 days,

136
00:07:09,730 --> 00:07:11,330
they were correct 80% of the time.

137
00:07:12,190 --> 00:07:16,030
It's a really good sweet spot for delivery,

138
00:07:16,030 --> 00:07:17,710
which I think why for teams using Scrum,

139
00:07:17,710 --> 00:07:22,270
why two weeks sprint, gross, works really well.

140
00:07:22,990 --> 00:07:26,270
What I found is anything over four weeks

